                                                "sense_id": "2db75aae-b5d7-3f15-b3fc-9b6345d25de1",
                                                "text": "The Board of Immigration Appeals concluded homeschoolers are too ‘amorphous” to constitute a social group eligible for protection under the asylum law."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6faf4fa-0a9f-4b87-ab91-719267763279",
                                                "sense_id": "2db75aae-b5d7-3f15-b3fc-9b6345d25de1",
                                                "text": "Dr. Jessie Voigts, a homeschooler and founder of Wandering Educators, a global community of educators sharing travel experiences, said it doesn’t matter if this time is structured or unstructured, so long as the kids get outside."
                                            }
